                        "review": "I loved this game when I first tried it on my Index in 2019.\n\nIndex didn't work out for me in the long run, so I wasn't able to play it for years. Fast forward to today, just received my Steam Frame, and excitedly boot up Ultrawings as my first game on the Frame.\n\nI cannot progress past the \"Press Any Button!\" screen now. This issue leaves the game unplayable. Looking at the discussion board here, it sounds like this is a common issue across many headsets. \n",
